1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,786
Draw a circle with your left hand

2
00:00:01,786 --> 00:00:04,260
and a straight line with your right.

3
00:00:04,260 --> 00:00:05,730
Bent, right?

4
00:00:05,730 --> 00:00:06,680
Your hands are copying

5
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:08,000
each other's homework.

6
00:00:08,040 --> 00:00:09,797
Each hand gets its own half

7
00:00:09,797 --> 00:00:10,800
of your brain.

8
00:00:10,842 --> 00:00:11,840
But the halves chat

9
00:00:11,840 --> 00:00:13,011
over a bridge...

10
00:00:13,011 --> 00:00:15,467
and your circle leaks across.

11
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:16,520
Proof?

12
00:00:16,520 --> 00:00:18,300
Two patients with that bridge cut

13
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,967
drew both shapes...

14
00:00:20,060 --> 00:00:21,833
better than YOU.

15
00:00:21,870 --> 00:00:22,680
Weirder?

16
00:00:22,680 --> 00:00:23,747
People missing an arm

17
00:00:23,747 --> 00:00:25,426
still bend the line...

18
00:00:25,426 --> 00:00:27,933
circling a GHOST hand.

19
00:00:28,110 --> 00:00:30,130
Your hands aren't clumsy.

20
00:00:30,130 --> 00:00:31,378
They're cheating.

